      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mulberry_Grove%2C_Illinois",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Bond County Historical Society’s museum in Greenville preserves artifacts that tell Mulberry Grove’s unique story.",
